01:21:55.477 --> 01:21:56.944
So, how's it going?


01:21:58.079 --> 01:22:00.314
Pretty fucking hard,
actually.


01:22:01.216 --> 01:22:02.483
Yeah?


01:22:02.485 --> 01:22:04.385
Yeah, I had to
move back in
with my dad.


01:22:05.453 --> 01:22:07.121
Hmm.
It's,


01:22:07.355 --> 01:22:08.656
It's been all right.


01:22:09.224 --> 01:22:10.624
He, um,


01:22:11.660 --> 01:22:13.928
he really loves
being a grandpa.


01:22:15.230 --> 01:22:16.597
Well, that's great.


01:22:22.037 --> 01:22:23.304
So, how about you?


01:22:24.706 --> 01:22:26.073
Me?


01:22:26.408 --> 01:22:27.675
Um,


01:22:30.345 --> 01:22:32.446
I'm considering
my options.


01:22:37.652 --> 01:22:39.720
It's going to be
one lucky kid.


01:22:40.555 --> 01:22:42.156
(BABY COOING)


01:22:42.958 --> 01:22:44.058
Hey.


01:22:44.060 --> 01:22:48.028
I really should
get him home
for his nap, so.


01:22:48.997 --> 01:22:50.230
Well, we're
going that way.


01:22:55.437 --> 01:22:56.603
Come on, Joyce.


01:22:57.205 --> 01:22:58.272
Come on.


01:22:58.606 --> 01:22:59.707
Let's go visit.


01:23:02.143 --> 01:23:03.610
Are you
okay there?
Yeah.


01:23:03.612 --> 01:23:05.012
Okay.


01:23:05.146 --> 01:23:06.213
Good dog.


01:23:07.182 --> 01:23:08.482
So, um.


01:23:09.284 --> 01:23:10.985
ANDIE: Is Justin
legal yet?


01:23:10.987 --> 01:23:12.252
(LIZZIE LAUGHS)


01:23:13.488 --> 01:23:15.723
He's got another
couple of weeks.
ANDIE: Yeah?


01:23:16.157 --> 01:23:17.658
Send him
my way.
I will.


01:23:17.660 --> 01:23:19.626
His French
is very, very good.


01:23:20.528 --> 01:23:22.363
Getting better
all the time.


01:23:22.365 --> 01:23:24.164
Action's a little
slow these days.


01:23:24.166 --> 01:23:26.200
I'm happy to go
a little bit younger.


01:23:26.202 --> 01:23:28.335
Well, you gotta do
what you gotta do.


01:23:29.104 --> 01:23:31.205
You know,
I think my dad's
new girlfriend


01:23:31.207 --> 01:23:32.773
is actually younger
than Justin.


01:23:33.308 --> 01:23:34.475
Oh, my God.


01:23:35.444 --> 01:23:38.779
Do you know
that they actually have
a kid on the way?


01:23:38.781 --> 01:23:40.280
(GASPING) No way.


01:23:40.282 --> 01:23:46.120
No, really. It's weird,
because I don't know if she's
sure how babies get made.

